{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
proposal_notes.liquid — mirror a proposal's notes into the intranet
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CORRECTED 2026-08-31 — this template is NOT redundant with the API.
`proposal/details` (called with `Id`, not `ProposalId`) returns two different
things and only one of them is readable:

  CustomerNotes  string  the scope text on the quote. Populated ~56%.
                         Synced by sync_proposal_engagement.py — no Liquid needed.
  ProposalNotes  array   the internal notes with author + timestamp.
                         EMPTY on all 30 proposals checked.

So the rep's running commentary on a quote — the part that says why it stalled
— is only reachable this way, exactly like appointment notes. It also arrives
PUSH rather than pull: a note added the hour after a quote goes out ("wants to
think it over till payday") lands before the next daily sync, not after it.

Per the Liquid Objects reference, Proposal exposes both `notes` (List<Note>)
and `proposal_notes` (List<ProposalNote>); `notes` carries the author and
timestamp, so that is what this emits.

INSTALL (once per brand):
  Control Panel -> Notifications -> Proposal Sent   (repeat for Accepted/Declined)
    body format: PLAIN TEXT
    SUBJECT: SM-PROP {{ proposal.id }}
    deliver to: firstgentalent@gmail.com
      (NOT the ingest-email edge function — that is an HTTP webhook and
       ServiceMinder notifications send email. firstgentalent is the inbox
       Goldeneye already sweeps every run via the Zapier Gmail connection.)
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
---SM-NOTES-JSON-BEGIN---
{
  "source": "proposal",
  "brand": {{ proposal.organization.name | json }},
  "contact_id": {{ proposal.contact_id | json }},
  "appointment_id": {{ proposal.appointment_id | json }},
  "proposal_id": {{ proposal.id | json }},
  "subject_label": {{ proposal.contact.name | json }},
  "cancel_reason_id": null,
  "cancel_reason": {{ proposal.decline_reason.name | json }},
  "cancelled_at": null,
  "notes": [
    {%- for n in proposal.notes -%}
    {
      "id": {{ n.id | json }},
      "title": {{ n.title | json }},
      "body": {{ n.body | json }},
      "private": {{ n.private | json }},
      "created_at": {{ n.created_at | json }},
      "created_by": {{ n.created_by.name | json }}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
---SM-NOTES-JSON-END---
